{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 8, "text": "一个说完后，另一个接着对，如果对不上，就受到观看人取笑。把“四句”说完后，石、", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 614, "w": 1476, "h": 72}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个说完后，另一个接着对，如果对不上，就受到观看人取笑。把“四句”说完后，石、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 614, "w": 1476, "h": 72}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 9, "text": "木二匠请主人站中央，说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 692, "w": 450, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "木二匠请主人站中央，说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 692, "w": 450, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
