{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 12, "text": "并在主人背面拴着围腰，一边一个人扶着牵起围腰角，称为接金银财宝，讨口封。石", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 881, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "并在主人背面拴着围腰，一边一个人扶着牵起围腰角，称为接金银财宝，讨口封。石", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 881, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 13, "text": "匠、木匠把梁粑抛在主人家的围腰内说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 945, "w": 700, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "匠、木匠把梁粑抛在主人家的围腰内说：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 945, "w": 700, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 14, "text": "“我今赐你一锭金，", "bbox_px": {"x": 458, "y": 1009, "w": 339, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“我今赐你一锭金，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 458, "y": 1009, "w": 339, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 435, "line_no": 15, "text": "荣华富贵管万民。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 1074, "w": 330, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "荣华富贵管万民。”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 1074, "w": 330, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
